{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate universe, YAGOO doesn't start a VTuber agency\u2014instead, he opens a caf\u00e9! But things quickly go downhill. Just when all hope seems lost a mysterious portal appears, and VTubers from our world step through to help him turn his caf\u00e9 business around!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Caf\u00e9 themed Hololive game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/62ac3cb9dbdb74d3a14c26da7793202e.poster.avif?t=1762225010\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/62ac3cb9dbdb74d3a14c26da7793202e.webm?t=1762225010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/62ac3cb9dbdb74d3a14c26da7793202e.mp4?t=1762225010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seat customers, take their orders, cook their order and serve food! Keep customers happy and the caf\u00e9 will flourish!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>17 playable idols!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/3ac3a1f955103b4600fa620e0a1ede45.avif?t=1762225010\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring idols from Gen 0, Gen 1, Myth and Hololive Indonesia Generation 1!\u00a0Each idol has her own unique ability! You start with just Tokino Sora, but you can get the help of other Hololive members through the Gacha!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improve the Cafe!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/23b02a2304538dca18b79d6268931a37.poster.avif?t=1762225010\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/23b02a2304538dca18b79d6268931a37.webm?t=1762225010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/23b02a2304538dca18b79d6268931a37.mp4?t=1762225010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From upgrading the building to buying new tables and furniture, you can slowly improve the caf\u00e9!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random events!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/cc71f45d3fe29f231b55383a47baebf9.avif?t=1762225010\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events at the end of each shift keep you on your toes! Both good and bad, complete with unique idol interactions!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923440?t=1762225010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/11f9a4d85e8824060b5ef7b2becdba68c78517be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762225010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/6f0567d299815066a8bb666af3180cff3f599a9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762225010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/6f0567d299815066a8bb666af3180cff3f599a9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762225010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate universe, YAGOO doesn't start a VTuber agency\u2014instead, he opens a caf\u00e9! But things quickly go downhill. Just when all hope seems lost a mysterious portal appears, and VTubers from our world step through to help him turn his caf\u00e9 business around!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Caf\u00e9 themed Hololive game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/62ac3cb9dbdb74d3a14c26da7793202e.poster.avif?t=1762225010\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/62ac3cb9dbdb74d3a14c26da7793202e.webm?t=1762225010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/62ac3cb9dbdb74d3a14c26da7793202e.mp4?t=1762225010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seat customers, take their orders, cook their order and serve food! Keep customers happy and the caf\u00e9 will flourish!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>17 playable idols!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/3ac3a1f955103b4600fa620e0a1ede45.avif?t=1762225010\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring idols from Gen 0, Gen 1, Myth and Hololive Indonesia Generation 1!\u00a0Each idol has her own unique ability! You start with just Tokino Sora, but you can get the help of other Hololive members through the Gacha!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improve the Cafe!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923440/extras/23b02a2304538dca18b79d6268931a37.poster.avif?t=1762225010\" width=61